graph TD
    AUTH_TOKEN[Payment Authorization Context Token] --> VALIDATE[1. Validate Cryptographic Signature & Expiration]
    VALIDATE --> LOCK[2. Acquire Redis 24h Idempotency Lock]
    LOCK --> RULE_CHK[3. Verify Amount & Merchant Match Intent]
    RULE_CHK --> ADAPTER[4. Invoke Razorpay Adapter executePayment]
    ADAPTER --> STATE_UPDATE[5. Persist State Transition inside DB Transaction]
    STATE_UPDATE --> OUTBOX[6. Write Domain Event to Outbox Table]
